5 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"patch_14\"><path d=\"M 100.144219 18.128 L 116.144219 18.128 L 116.144219 12.528 L 100.144219 12.528 z\n\" style=\"fill: #c2410c\"/></g><g id=\"text_19\"><g transform=\"translate(122.544219 18.128) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-2f\" d=\"M 269 4678 Q 269 4710 285 4729 Q 301 4749 346 4749 L 3789 4749 Q 3827 4749 3846 4729 Q 3866 4710 3866 4678 L 3866 4346 Q 3866 4282 3789 4282 L 2490 4282 Q 2419 4282 2419 4218 L 2419 83 Q 2419 0 2342 0 L 1882 0 Q 1805 0 1805 83 L 1805 4211 Q 1805 4282 1741 4282 L 346 4282 Q 269 4282 269 4346 L 269 4678 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-4f\" d=\"M 582 0 Q 499 0 499 83 L 499 4666 Q 499 4749 570 4749 L 947 4749 Q 1018 4749 1018 4672 L 1018 2963 Q 1018 2931 1030 2924 Q 1043 2918 1075 2944 Q 1299 3117 1488 3232 Q 1677 3347 1859 3401 Q 2042 3456 2259 3456 Q 2758 3456 3020 3190 Q 3283 2925 3283 2483 L 3283 102 Q 3283 0 3187 0 L 2829 0 Q 2784 0 2765 22 Q 2746 45 2746 83 L 2746 2368 Q 2746 2682 2586 2858 Q 2426 3034 2080 3034 Q 1894 3034 1731 2973 Q 1568 2912 1401 2800 Q 1235 2688 1037 2515 L 1037 96 Q 1037 0 934 0 L 582 0 L 582 0 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" d=\"M 1030 109 Q 1030 45 1008 22 Q 986 0 915 0 L 589 0 Q 531 0 512 19 Q 493 38 493 90 L 493 3302 Q 493 3392 570 3392 L 960 3392 Q 1030 3392 1030 3309 L 1030 109 z\nM 1056 4122 Q 1056 4000 941 4000 L 570 4000 Q 512 4000 493 4029 Q 474 4058 474 4109 L 474 4646 Q 474 4749 563 4749 L 966 4749 Q 1056 4749 1056 4653 L 1056 4122 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-2f\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-4f\" transform=\"translate(64.5 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-50\" transform=\"translate(122.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-6a\" transform=\"translate(146.8125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a5\" transform=\"translate(198.015625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-75\" transform=\"translate(219.421875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-48\" transform=\"translate(270.125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-3b\" transform=\"translate(328.21875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-69\" transform=\"translate(383.015625 0)\"/></g></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p0949c2da26\"><rect x=\"20.391719\" y=\"27.296\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"144.144\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 2 · Prepaid churn (% of customers leaving per month) by age","note":null},"answer":"<p>Churn among <b>18-25s jumped from 3% to 8% a month</b>; other ages barely moved. Young, digital, data-hungry users are leaving, almost certainly for Zap. <b>So-what:</b> this is a targeted competitive attack, not a general problem with Vertex.</p>"},{"q":"Vertex could launch its own digital brand at $15. It expects to win back 400,000 subscribers, but ~2% of its 3.3M postpaid customers (paying $35/month) might switch down to it. Net effect?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>Gain = 400k × $15 × 12 = <b>+$72M/year</b>. Loss = 2% × 3.3M = 66k × ($35 − $15) × 12 ≈ <b>−$16M/year</b>.</p> <p>Net ≈ <b>+$56M/year</b>, recovering ~45% of the lost revenue. A digital brand is also cheaper to run (no shops).</p>"}],"reco":"Vertex's revenue drop is entirely in prepaid, driven by 18-25 year-olds leaving for a competitor's $15 digital brand. I recommend launching Vertex's own digital-only brand at a similar price. It recovers ~$56M a year net of postpaid customers switching down. Keep it clearly separate from postpaid (app-only, no handset deals) to limit switching. Next steps: a 3-month launch plan, and a retention offer for young prepaid users whose contracts are ending.","great":["Isolates the stream before diagnosing","Splits subscribers vs revenue per user","Includes postpaid customers switching down in the maths"],"id":13,"slug":"vertex-mobile"}